From c19f462195bbe91fea259a72238022c9b72b69a6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: logdog2325 <226450061+logdog2325@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 15:23:10 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] XD Netplay: guest ready check

A seated joiner presses Ready (new XdReady message); the host's Start, on
desktop and Android, waits for every seated joiner's Ready and names who it
is waiting for. Each Start clears it.
---
